  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please implement a way to launch from links on Quest, or increase the 1/wk labs limit.\n\nGiven the 1/wk Labs limit, this makes testing Quest worlds hard.  The only way for a third party to test someone's world is for a PC user to join it and invite a Quest user.  Given that many world creators do not have the hardware, this makes testing others' content more difficult--you have to publish cross-platform, and use alts or coordinate test times across timezones.",
